			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0201: Posting]"
				""
				"The Calla is a farming town that remembers being more than that."
				"Good soil, long rows, and people who look up at the sky a little too often."
				"Feed them first. Then build them a factory. They'll trust the second because you did the first."
				"Your goal here: &bClearance Level 2&r."
			]
